{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"overall\": [\"C1\", \"C2\", \"C3\", \"C4\"],\n  \"keep\": [\"C4\", \"C1\", \"C2\", \"C3\"],\n  \"cover\": [\"C1\", \"C4\", \"C2\", \"C3\"],\n  \"lean\": [\"C2\", \"C3\", \"C1\", \"C4\"],\n  \"plain\": [\"C2\", \"C3\", \"C1\", \"C4\"],\n  \"why\": \"overall：C1的因果推进最自然，从尚未弄清自己的心事，到不甘与退缩并存，再到熟悉感唤起向前的念头、过去却无法回来，最后落到反复犹豫；C2、C3更简洁但少了一层未缓过神来的状态，C4则过度展开。keep：C4明确保留了不知道往哪里走，也最完整地写出不甘心照旧、害怕投入失去东西、想停又逼自己撑住的双重拉扯；C1次之，C2、C3没有充分保留照旧意味着承认现状本该如此这一层。cover：C1用尚未缓过神、熟悉感回来而过去不能复得、硬撑与想停并存，解释了珠子中几种听感为何同时出现；C4覆盖面也广，但身体先记得怎么往前更接近复述听感，而非提供个人经历上的理由。lean：C2、C3的四步推进最紧凑，C1对舍不得的交代略有重复，C4多出身体记忆、意识方向不明等步骤，且有重复说明不清楚的倾向。plain：C2、C3的“不甘心”“硬撑”“想停一停”最像一个人在直说自己的处境；C1的“等于认了它们本该如此”稍显概念化，C4的比喻和心理分步则最像经过设计的阐释。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8d7e01e0-a756-4298-b003-6a4947f2b257", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T005008285364Z", "elapsed_seconds": 58.907, "completed_utc": "2026-10-30T00:51:07.192349+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "162b439f800339de72faa97bc33f1d03e375755ff395365b0e919dfa0ec8c56e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_cou